an class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>存在跳变与不连续</td>\n<td>量大整段优惠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>免费额度 + 单一价</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(q) = p \\cdot \\max(0,\\ q - b_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>连续、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(b_0)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>先送一点再按量收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[用量 q] --&gt; T{阶梯类型}&#10;  T --&gt;|累进| G[逐段累加&lt;br/&gt;F = Σ p_i × 段内量]&#10;  T --&gt;|整段| V[定位所在段&lt;br/&gt;F = p_k × q]&#10;  T --&gt;|免费额度| A[F = p × max 0, q-b0]&#10;  G --&gt; R[应计金额]&#10;  V --&gt; R&#10;  A --&gt; R\">graph TD\n  Q[用量 q] --&gt; T{阶梯类型}\n  T --&gt;|累进| G[逐段累加&lt;br/&gt;F = Σ p_i × 段内量]\n  T --&gt;|整段| V[定位所在段&lt;br/&gt;F = p_k × q]\n  T --&gt;|免费额度| A[F = p × max 0, q-b0]\n  G --&gt; R[应计金额]\n  V --&gt; R\n  A --&gt; R</pre><h2 id=\"累进阶梯的逐段累加\">累进阶梯的逐段累加</h2><p>累进阶梯是三者中唯一「每多消费一个单位，边际成本不上升」的形态，因此也是最容易被租户接受、最少引发争议的。AWS 的 S3 存储、EC2 出流量、多数云厂商的资源计费都采用这种形态。</p>\n<p>它的实现要点是<strong>逐段累加，而绝不能简化为「平均单价 × 总量」</strong>。用平均单价会算错，因为每一段的单价只作用于落在该段内的量。</p>\n<p>举一个可核验的形态：某平台 API 计费分三段，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_0=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_1=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 万次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_2=1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 万次；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1 = 0.10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span></span></span></span></span> 元/千次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.08</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2 = 0.08</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.08</span></span></span></span></span> 元/千次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_3 = 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span> 元/千次。租户本期用了 1500 万次：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1500</mn><mtext>w</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext>w</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.08</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>900</mn><mtext>w</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext>w</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(1500\\text{w}) = 0.10 \\cdot 100\\text{w}/1000 + 0.08 \\cdot 900\\text{w}/1000 + 0.05 \\cdot 500\\text{w}/1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">w</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">w</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.08</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">900</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">w</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">w</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/1000</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即前 100 万次按 0.10，接下来的 900 万次按 0.08，最后的 500 万次按 0.05。若错误地用「总量 × 最低单价」或「总量 × 平均单价」计算，金额会明显偏低或偏高。这个错误在实现上通常表现为「先算出总量再套一个价格函数」，而正确的实现是先把总量切成段。</p>\n<p>逐段累加还有一个数值上的注意点：累加必须在<strong>最小计量单位</strong>上做（见 <a href=\"subscription-usage-hybrid\">订阅与用量混合计费</a>），每段内部的乘法可以先算出精确的小数，但加总后再统一舍入一次。分段本身不引入额外的舍入——如果把每段的金额各自舍入再相加，总额会与「总量一次性计算」产生偏差，且这个偏差随段数增长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"整段阶梯的不连续性\">整段阶梯的不连续性</h2><p>整段阶梯（volume pricing）按用量落在哪一段，对<strong>全部用量</strong>套用该段单价。它会产生一个反直觉的现象：用量跨过边界时账单金额可能反而下降。</p>\n<p>沿用上面的分段，若整段单价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1=0.10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.06</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2=0.06</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.06</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.04</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_3=0.04</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.04</span></span></span></span></span>（元/千次，边界 100 万与 1000 万次），则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用量 9,999,000 次（落在第二段）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9999</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.06</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>599.94</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9999 \\times 0.06 = 599.94</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9999</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.06</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">599.94</span></span></span></span></span> 元</li>\n<li>用量 10,001,000 次（落在第三段）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10001</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.04</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>400.04</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10001 \\times 0.04 = 400.04</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10001</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.04</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400.04</span></span></span></span></span> 元</li>\n</ul>\n<p>多用了 2000 次，账单反而少了近 200 元。这个跳变不是 bug，是整段阶梯的数学性质，但它对系统有三个真实的要求：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，边界处的行为必须被显式定义并对外说明。</strong> 租户完全可能（并且合理地）把自己的用量精确控制在边界之下或之上。合同与价目表必须写清楚边界值的归属（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q = b_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 属于第几段），否则会出现双方各自按有利解释计算的争议。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，阶梯边界不能用来做配额拦截的依据。</strong> 见过一种错误设计：把整段阶梯的边界当作配额阈值，用量接近边界时告警。这在累进阶梯下也许说得通（多用量会多花钱），但在整段阶梯下完全说不通——用户跨过边界反而更便宜，告警毫无意义。配额拦截的依据是套餐包含量与硬上限，见 <a href=\"../quota-enforcement/quota-limit-enforce\">用量配额限制与超额策略</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，整段阶梯使「用量越多越省」成为可能，因此容易被滥用。</strong> 如果一个租户按 10,001,000 次付费比按 9,999,000 次更便宜，理性的做法是主动多报用量——只要多报的量不产生真实成本。这对按请求计费的 API 不成立（多报就要真发请求），但对按「存储容量」这类可以虚报的计量项就有风险。防护手段是计量项的物理可核验性（见 <a href=\"../usage-metering/usage-event-collect\">API 与资源用量事件采集</a> 中关于采集源头的讨论）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配额与计费的交界\">配额与计费的交界</h2><p>「配额」这个词在计费系统里有两个不同含义，混淆它们会产生严重的实现错误：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>是什么</th>\n<th>归属章节</th>\n<th>超限后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计费配额</td>\n<td>套餐包含量（included quota）</td>\n<td>本篇 / 第二章</td>\n<td>超出的部分按超额单价计费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>强制配额</td>\n<td>硬性资源上限（hard limit）</td>\n<td>第四章</td>\n<td>超出部分被拒绝或降级服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>计费配额是<strong>价格的一部分</strong>，它不阻止任何请求，只决定「从第几个单位开始收钱」。强制配额是<strong>安全与容量的一部分</strong>，它阻止请求，与单价无关。一个套餐通常同时具备两者，且强制配额高于计费配额（例如包含 1000 万次、硬上限 5000 万次），中间这段是「加价但不拦截」的区间。</p>\n<p>实现上必须把它们放在不同的数据通路：计费配额由账期内的窗口读数累计决定（离线、可延迟），强制配额由实时计数器决定（在线、秒级），后者的实现见 <a href=\"../quota-enforcement/quota-limit-enforce\">用量配额限制与超额策略</a>。试图用同一套读数同时服务两者，会在两个方向上都做不好。</p>\n<p>免费额度（free tier）是计费配额的一个特例：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一个不收费的量。它的特殊之处在于<strong>它通常是按租户而非按账号发放的</strong>。一个平台如果给每个子账号免费额度，而租户可以无限创建子账号，那么免费额度就是无限量。因此免费额度的发放对象必须与计费主体（tenant_id）绑定，这一点在采集层解析计费主体时就已确定（见 <a href=\"../usage-metering/usage-event-collect\">API 与资源用量事件采集</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价目表的数据结构\">价目表的数据结构</h2><p>阶梯定价无法用「单价」一个字段表达，它需要一张显式的分段表。一张够用的数据结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"price_tier&#10;  plan_version_id  -- 所属价目版本&#10;  meter            -- 计量项&#10;  tier_index       -- 段序（0 起）&#10;  lower_bound      -- 段下界（含），最小计量单位&#10;  upper_bound      -- 段上界（不含），NULL 表示无上界&#10;  unit_price       -- 段单价，最小货币单位的整数倍率&#10;  pricing_type     -- graduated | volume&#10;  free_quantity    -- 免费量（仅 tier_index=0 有效）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>price_tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  plan_version_id  -- 所属价目版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  meter            -- 计量项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tier_index       -- 段序（0 起）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lower_bound      -- 段下界（含），最小计量单位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  upper_bound      -- 段上界（不含），NULL 表示无上界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  unit_price       -- 段单价，最小货币单位的整数倍率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pricing_type     -- graduated | volume</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  free_quantity    -- 免费量（仅 tier_index=0 有效）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个设计要点。<code>upper_bound</code> 用「不含」而非「含」，是为了让相邻段无重叠也无空隙——边界值恰好属于上一段或下一段是明确的。<code>unit_price</code> 存的是「每多少个最小计量单位收多少最小货币单位」的倍率，避免浮点（例如「每 1000 次 0.10 元」存成 <code>price_per_1000 = 10</code>，即万分之十）。<code>pricing_type</code> 按计量项整体标注而非按段标注，因为一个计量项不可能同时是累进与整段——这个约束应该在数据结构层面强制，而不是靠写入时小心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三种阶梯互不相同：累进阶梯逐段累加（连续、边际价递减），整段阶梯对全部用量套所在段单价（存在不连续跳变），免费额度 + 单一价是累进的特例。</li>\n<li>累进阶梯必须逐段累加，不能简化为「平均单价 × 总量」；分段不引入额外舍入，舍入只在最终总额上做一次。</li>\n<li>整段阶梯在边界处会出现「用得多反而便宜」，因此不能用它的边界做配额告警，其边界归属必须在合同中写明。</li>\n<li>计费配额（价格的一部分）与强制配额（安全的一部分）是两个不同的概念与数据通路，绝不能共用一套读数。</li>\n<li>免费额度必须与计费主体绑定，否则可被无限创建的子账号套利。</li>\n<li>阶梯价目需要一个显式的分段表结构，段的上下界约定「下含上不含」以保证无重叠无空隙，单价以整数倍率存储。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"阶梯、超额与配额计费","id":"阶梯-超额与配额计费"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"累进阶梯的逐段累加","id":"累进阶梯的逐段累加"},{"level":2,"text":"整段阶梯的不连续性","id":"整段阶梯的不连续性"},{"level":2,"text":"配额与计费的交界","id":"配额与计费的交界"},{"level":2,"text":"价目表的数据结构","id":"价目表的数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"订阅与用量混合计费","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/tenant-metering-billing/billing-model/subscription-usage-hybrid"},"next":{"title":"计费套餐版本化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/tenant-metering-billing/billing-model/price-plan-version"}}